pan style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">관심 있는 분들은 참고 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></font></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><br><br><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>연수 개요<br></strong></span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">연수기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">인당 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1~2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개월 이내<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">연수장소 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">연수기관 사업장</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">민간기관</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">공공기관</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">국가 또는 지방자치단체 등</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">연수대상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">대학</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">교</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">에 재학 또는 휴학 중인 장애대학생<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">모집인원 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">300</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">명<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">단위 </span><span style=\"FON